amed after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"title":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" patch, which wires its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"output ","type":"text"},{"code":"Position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"card snaps back to its resting position.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","role":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityTextContentType(_:)":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityTextContentType(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilitytextcontenttype(_:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"accessibilityTextContentType(_:)","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityTextContentType"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI28Accessibi